    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds have caught your attention, their noise is tormenting\u2014it\u2019s time to scare them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just a Little Purr suit</i> is a turn-based strategy puzzle game. <strong>65 handcrafted levels</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>a fun adventure designed for the whole family! With no time limit, you can choose a direction and use cards to perform an available action within the level, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common movement cards:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards that move the kitten forward by slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If in doubt, <strong>you can undo the action.</strong> The card will return to its initial position. Explore different solutions to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Cannon Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to choose the direction to launch the kitten, propelling it by the distance specified on the card. Remember, every cat always lands on its feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Trampoline Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction cannot be chosen, but you can determine the distance. However, it will always move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Portal Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some myths say cats travel between mysterious universes. In <i>Little Purrsuit</i>, this myth is true. The portal will always appear ahead of the kitten, allowing it to pass from one portal to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Create new Platform Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creates a new platform to aid in navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will challenge you! Boosters and totems can either help or hinder you by changing your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds have caught your attention, their noise is tormenting\u2014it\u2019s time to scare them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just a Little Purr suit</i> is a turn-based strategy puzzle game. <strong>65 handcrafted levels</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>a fun adventure designed for the whole family! With no time limit, you can choose a direction and use cards to perform an available action within the level, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common movement cards:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards that move the kitten forward by slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/cb3f4dda6c98835717f12103a978cacc.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If in doubt, <strong>you can undo the action.</strong> The card will return to its initial position. Explore different solutions to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Cannon Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to choose the direction to launch the kitten, propelling it by the distance specified on the card. Remember, every cat always lands on its feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/3c76a440da9a6aae360fab20f458ba39.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Trampoline Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction cannot be chosen, but you can determine the distance. However, it will always move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/7718a64453dea45bf59c8917fd236eba.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Portal Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some myths say cats travel between mysterious universes. In <i>Little Purrsuit</i>, this myth is true. The portal will always appear ahead of the kitten, allowing it to pass from one portal to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/63343c763c11b805ae4f72fc96cf13ca.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Create new Platform Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creates a new platform to aid in navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/c19cbb3bc606f3842605e5d93635c37f.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will challenge you! Boosters and totems can either help or hinder you by changing your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.poster.avif?t=1755038896\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.webm?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377720/extras/b1c6f49e9554425c4cca4548db86a9b8.mp4?t=1755038896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In Just a Little Purr_suit, use cards to guide the kitten along the path. Use cannons, trampolines, and even interdimensional portals to reach the bird as quickly as possible and scare it away.",
